{
  "_why": "One statement of the tenant reservation, asserted by both implementations. Neither generates it: if either arithmetic moves, its own suite goes red against this file and the disagreement is visible before it reaches a cluster. Sizes are given in Gi for legibility; the expectations are exact bytes and milli-CPU.",
